    /// Generation counter for list-load streams. Every new load (service
    /// switch, refresh, watch pass) bumps it; `load_resources_async` gives
    /// each stream a forwarder that relays events only while its captured
    /// generation is still current. A superseded stream's remaining events —
    /// batches, `ResourcesFullyLoaded`, errors — are dropped before they can
